# Final Rule

A sprint is NOT complete until:

- Every applicable criterion in this file is satisfied for that sprint
- It can be explained, demonstrated, and defended in a Senior/Staff/Principal SDET interview

**Anti-pattern (Sprint 1):** Do not mark a sprint complete or advance the roadmap to the next sprint when epics remain open. Design docs without implementation do not satisfy Epic 3 or Epic 4.